Diagnosed cause (stated in test comments, lines 8-14):
"bun cannot render React Native, so this test computes the layout with yoga-layout -- the flexbox 
engine React Native uses -- configured the way React Native 0.86 configures it (YGErrataAll...)"

Code fix location (mobile/src/app/chat.tsx, lines 548-550):
Added width: "85%" to assistantMessage style.
Diagnosis comment (lines 549-551):
"List text is flex: 1 (flexBasis 0), so a shrink-wrapped bubble measured only the bullets and
took its width from other content, then sized its height for text wider than it drew."

